    "5 cups white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons vinegar",
    "1 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine whole strawberries, sugar, vinegar, and salt together in a large stockpot. Bring to a rolling boil, and cook stirring frequently for 15 to 20 minutes, or until the temperature of the mixture has reached 220 degrees F (105 degrees C).",
